{"id":1584,"date":"2023-02-21T05:29:42","date_gmt":"2023-02-21T12:29:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/citruscapital.ca\/?page_id=1584"},"modified":"2023-03-05T01:09:30","modified_gmt":"2023-03-05T08:09:30","slug":"business-coaching","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/citruscapital.ca\/business-coaching\/","title":{"rendered":"Business Coaching"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1584\" class=\"elementor elementor-1584\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-ekjheoq elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"ekjheoq\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-25748b2d\" data-id=\"25748b2d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-253d822f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"253d822f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Business Coaching<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1dca66c4 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"1dca66c4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-aba1729 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"aba1729\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f531b19\" data-id=\"f531b19\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2bc2ce0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2bc2ce0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We believe that everything you need to create a business and life you love is already inside of you! And yet, we get it. Starting and scaling a business can be overwhelming and\u00a0 confusing. We are here to help you navigate the ins and outs of the business world, keep you moving forward and challenge your comfort zone so you can take your business to the next level.<\/p><p>Our goal is to help you identify what lights you up so we can emphasize your leadership strengths, mitigate weaknesses and establish a clear path to making better business decisions and manifesting your overall vision, beyond what your mind ever thought was possible.<\/p><p>Some tools we may use:<\/p><ul><li>Strategy session to discuss and define your vision, mission and goals<\/li><li>Strategic planning for the growth and sustainability of your business<\/li><li>Professional advice and experience sharing to help you gain valuable perspective<\/li><li>Creation and implementation of processes and procedures<\/li><li>Clarity and definition of your goals, with accountability to ensure you reach them<\/li><li>Re-connecting you with your wise inner voice to help you achieve your dreams<\/li><\/ul><p>Our strategies and coaching are 100% tailored to your needs and will be adapted to each individual. The above list is an example of some of our tools that we may use in working together.<\/p><p>Ready to learn more?<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8c7647 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"c8c7647\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/citruscapital.ca\/contact-us\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Book a Meeting<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Business Coaching We believe that everything you need to create a business and life you love is already inside of you! And yet, we get it. Starting and scaling a business can be overwhelming and\u00a0 confusing. We are here to help you navigate the ins and outs of the business world, keep you moving forward [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":7,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"site-side